Overlay patch 0042: the engine boots once per process, period (= reference
0026, rebased to Game.cpp; VISION-PRO-LUS-PLAYBOOK Phase 01).
visionOS scene reconnects (window-resize stress) re-invoked the process
entry and re-ran the game's main() in-process — through MORE than one
UIKit path on the Ship of Harkinian port: a postFinishLaunch-level guard (their SDL
compat patch, our 0038) shipped and was BYPASSED (device log: two engine
inits 55 s apart with singletons alive across them). Guard at the
chokepoint every path must cross: the game's main(). The shell separately
re-attaches the existing SDL window to a reconnected scene (synced
SohIosShell.m SceneDidActivate block, which assumes this guard exists).
Ours lands in src/port/Game.cpp (the main= SDL_main TU, overlay 0013).

